From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:36:44 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Meridian: Context Insights names a model switch as what made
 a turn cost

The prompt cache is per model: after a switch (Sonnet to Opus, say) the
next request writes the whole context again. The cost chart called that
"unknown"; now it says "Model switched from Sonnet 4.5 to Opus 5.5: the
cache is per model, so 20.4k tokens written again", only when the
transcript shows the model changed and the cache collapsed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
